    "single_active_share_class_pro_rata_rule": "SINGLE_CLASS_UIT_PRO_RATA requires a date-covering SEC filing proving equal proportionate undivided interests in one trust portfolio, one economically active mapped class, exact-date class TNA equal to pooled TNA within tolerance, a dated ETF-security crosswalk, and a passing portfolio identity",
